Resources for StretchRes
=======================

This directory is part of the StretchRes Theos project structure. For this 
jailbreak tweak, the Resources directory serves the following purposes:

Primary Purpose
--------------

The Resources directory is designated for any bundle resources such as:
- Application/icon images
- Default/launch images
- Asset catalogs
- Localization files
- Helper scripts or data files

StretchRes Specific Content
----------------------------

Since StretchRes is a preference bundle-only tweak (no springboard overlay,
no custom icon, no in-app purchases, no external media), the Resources directory
does not contain any binary or image assets. The tweak's "icon" is the default 
iOS Substrate tweak icon, and the interface is entirely delivered through the
OS preference settings panel via PSPreferences specifiers.

What Would Go Here (If Needed)
--------------------------------

If future development adds:
- Custom default images for the preference panel
- Localization files for multiple languages
- Helper data files or configuration resources
- Screenshot assets for the tweak listing

They would be placed in this directory. The Makefile does not currently 
reference any resources from this directory, as the tweak's functionality
is delivered through:
- Theos Substrate runtime method hooking (Tweak.x)
- PSPreferences specifier plists (Root.plist)
- NSUserDefaults for preference persistence

Compatibility Notes
-------------------

- iOS 15.0–15.8.8 compatible
- Dopamine rootless jailbreak compatible
- No dependency on bundle resources for core functionality

Files in this directory:
